    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{22}{7}$ is only an approximation to $\\pi$. The decimal expansion of $\\pi$ is non-terminating and non-recurring, so $\\pi$ is irrational.",
      "worked": "$\\pi\\ne\\frac{22}{7}$; the fraction is only an approximation. The decimal expansion of $\\pi$ is non-terminating and non-recurring, so $\\pi$ cannot be written as a fraction of integers and is irrational.",
